{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54069","headline":"偈四首 一 · 义忠","name":"偈四首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"即此见闻非见闻，无余声色可呈君。\n个中若了全（《宗镜录》卷九八作「浑」）无事，体用无（《五灯会元》卷五作「何」）妨分不分。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"义忠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54069.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54069","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}